  "question": {
    "text": "Which of the following figure represents the variation of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>R</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced></math> with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mi>A</mi></math> (if <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo></math>&nbsp;radius of a nucleus and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo></math> its mass number)",
